@guide H_Hellfire
@name Hellfire Peninsula (Thrallmar)
@faction Horde
@levels 58-62
@zone Hellfire Peninsula
@chapter Outland
@desc Through the Dark Portal to Thrallmar. Covers the Legion fronts, Reaver's Fall, Spinebreaker Post, Zeth'Gor, the Mag'har Grounds, Falcon Watch and the Cenarion Post. Hellfire Ramparts quests are optional.
@next H_Zangarmarsh

accept Through the Dark Portal [optional] | From the herald in Orgrimmar or Undercity (level 58).
turnin Through the Dark Portal [optional] | Lieutenant General Orion at the Stair of Destiny.
accept Arrival in Outland
turnin Arrival in Outland | Vlagga Freyfeather, wind rider master on the Stair.
accept Journey to Thrallmar
fly Thrallmar
fp Thrallmar
turnin Journey to Thrallmar | General Krakork.
accept Report to Nazgrel [optional]
turnin Report to Nazgrel [optional]
bind Thrallmar [area=3536]
accept Eradicate the Burning Legion | Nazgrel.
accept I Work... For the Horde! | Megzeg Nukklebust.
turnin Eradicate the Burning Legion | Sergeant Shatterskull, Reaver's Fall area.
